// ProjectDeliveryS653 — Sprint 653: Deliver dcModelParsesInParallel (issue443): the corpus parses and ingests across a thread pool and the model is what the serial build produced. Each file becomes its own sequence of item puts and edges inside the worker; the calling thread replays the sequences in declaration order, so the last-wins / first-wins semantics of add_item and add_item_typed are preserved without a lock on the shared map.. EXECUTE. 2 pts.
